{"id":"n73234-1-9","stage":3,"title":"확실하다 · 确实","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73234-1-9-1","ko":"승규가 진짜로 지수를 좋아한다고 했단 말이야?","zh":"承奎说他真的喜欢智秀吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}},{"text":"진짜로","meaning":"真的","explanation":"진짜：真的；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"진짜","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71539","senseId":"1","lemma":"진짜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진짜로","audio":"/audio/807bad5a82bfe056fa29.mp3"}},{"text":"지수를","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지수를","audio":"/audio/e9f75725b9488ce72144.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수를","audio":"/audio/e9f75725b9488ce72144.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아한다고","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"4","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아한다고","audio":"/audio/57c5375c6a02346907f3.mp3"}},{"text":"했단","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；단：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했단","audio":"/audio/12bff31207808fb8a874.mp3"}},{"text":"말이야?","meaning":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","explanation":"말：表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이야","audio":"/audio/fd5a3f00cd7342725148.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79eea25f740b5721","term":"진짜","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3","entryId":"71539","definition":"没有假装或虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["진짜"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"珍惜某人而感觉亲密或相互满意。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","pronunciation":["말ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/2d1cb93001ba76994591.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73234-1-9-2","ko":"그렇다니까. 내가 확실하게 들었어.","zh":"就是那样啊。我确实亲耳听到的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇다니까.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；다니까：再次强调已经说过的内容，非敬语：“都说了……”。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇다니까","audio":"/audio/8571200c2321a24d4706.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"확실하게","meaning":"确实，准确，确定","explanation":"확실하다：确实，准确，确定；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"확실하다","audio":"/audio/0c443e91aeb77d43cfe4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73234","senseId":"1","lemma":"확실하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"확실하게","audio":"/audio/dd940bfc2b04bea9ee34.mp3"}},{"text":"들었어.","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"1","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들었어","audio":"/audio/212b440366b02768c97f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"0c443e91aeb77d43","term":"확실하다","zh":"确实，准确，确定","audio":"/audio/0c443e91aeb77d43cfe4.mp3","entryId":"73234","definition":"与实际完全一样，或一定是那样。","pronunciation":["확씰하다"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"用耳朵接受声音。","pronunciation":["듣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7f5033e66cf04d131088.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.253,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73234","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":96,"sequenceScore":2.5564,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["就是那样啊。我确实亲耳听到的。","承奎说他真的喜欢智秀吗？","这是什么植物？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["承奎说他真的喜欢智秀吗？","这是什么植物？","就是那样啊。我确实亲耳听到的。"],"answer":2}]}
